  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2401.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2401.02 Applicability. This chapter shall apply to each ferrous or non-ferrous foundry, smelter, or investment casting operation in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #10315, eff 4-23-13; ss by #13694, eff 7-22-23",
